msgid "Cloudflare DNS Speedtest"
msgstr "Cloudflare DNS 优选"

msgid "After a speed test, only the configured domains are resolved by a dedicated mosdns instance returning the best IP; all other DNS queries keep using the existing resolver path."
msgstr "测速后仅将指定域名交给独立 mosdns 实例返回优选 IP；其他 DNS 查询继续使用原有链路。"

msgid "Grant access to Cloudflare DNS speedtest settings"
msgstr "授予访问 Cloudflare DNS 优选设置的权限"

